 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">
 Plastisol and water-based ink can each fit certain garments and artwork. Choose from the exact garment, ink system, proof, cure, use, care, and production-partner documentation. Protective apparel needs employer selection and manufacturer review.
 </p>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">
 Some shops specialize in one ink system. The right choice depends on the garment, artwork, and intended use. The production partner confirms available methods.
 </p>

